{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_4_001_03_d",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:a60ea95d7d4b088efe580061107ee57a5e2b772c94100a57d962e87d23e25d93",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_d:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2ac2c5ff781eda35d322a9a82320b59e3445b5fb86c8b571255adea7c8e9f1d7",
      "text": "我们的热情，切实传达给了\n在屏幕另一端看着的人们啊……",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_d:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:336df07fcbcbd34fe2e04b922fd178267ec740224c3cf65839ef73f19dc78463",
      "text": "好。燃起更强烈的意志，\n让更多的人看到315 Pro的活动吧！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_d:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d5f45ee2a021ec72929eba21eb7e60a99ae9f5b488c03e5bf8b136c67f031beb",
      "text": "是啊，我们的目标可是出战JIF！\n必须要让更多的人认识我们才行。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_d:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6dff144f13527826e0cdb0025465e68278481d3cd9b3ca5422b3e0cf860c8aed",
      "text": "……JAPAN IDOL FES，新人偶像的龙门跃升之选。\n想要获得出场资格，需要全国偶像粉丝的人气以及……？",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_d:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1d503867516ed5a1dd4fc2619aa8e13fde6307bd9935282e3ca59851c15cdb01",
      "text": "乐曲的销量与演唱会的实绩，还有，\n恐怕也需要得到音乐节赞助商们的认可。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_d:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3a81fe6e8663db006e5ce1eb6b38bccbc02ff61f18983f7caf60ac6a40011619",
      "text": "课题很多。不过，让我们一步一步向前迈进吧！\n总而言之现在，必须先磨炼作为偶像的力量。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_d:cmd-000076:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:065879c558a769062ec330b5b47270ef70cb0239299c05f5e53116a1f3cc8ce0",
      "text": "没错。既然重新梳理好了目标，\n差不多该去上课练习了吧！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_d:cmd-000084:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:73526ae8630aae6d640fed11adbe821790c300d89b85228e0b3281f754efd464",
      "text": "诚司先生、英雄先生，今天也请多多关照！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_d:cmd-000087:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4f258f2cbd2445838ac02e2bcb2856e8ec8aca0469f30a7a9a96454110174ad4",
      "text": "（大家干劲十足啊！\n为了不输给大家，今天我也要努力跑业务！）",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_d:cmd-000105:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:64e0d200f0504a02c665ef8b788e9652870d777e1f3d76d11a5ffe790edb879b",
      "text": "啊，●●●●●●●●●●监督！\n是我，悠介哦。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_d:cmd-000107:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:555a2bf6d17e93af95a4a5df1df200399ae42370e4dce3f553494e486389d040",
      "text": "关于频道开设纪念视频的事，\n我想到一个很棒的点子。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_d:cmd-000109:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b7cb70eee6f4d218839fae083cab267d7bacd6666ce26d74e378984928f96822",
      "text": "说起我和享介，果然还是足球吧？\n但是，光是普通的足球视频又不够有趣……",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_d:cmd-000111:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a45d7c8dd7b0d45ea827bc9d715d6d90a210925b3f0ce1cb7811c6d00356049e",
      "text": "“足球不落地度过一整天！”\n这个企划，怎么样？",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_d:cmd-000113:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9ec738e1947ef7d13c13f2da65da24c66037424a1d922c14ea1a06060ed17790",
      "text": "听起来很有趣呢",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_d:cmd-000114:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6946926200fe1e43deb596dfe8c4abb339de4d58fa38a251af36d21eb8fe2b1e",
      "text": "听起来好难啊",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_d:cmd-000115:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:672ab083e81c206eebfda2cffe80df6bdcaa4f745ab84b811dc45f51899d6fb9",
      "text": "播放量绝对会暴涨的！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_d:cmd-000117:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e7ea21b690928ad97de1116da2944b0fc7ae435c0d42b43ceb236c76a214d35b",
      "text": "对吧♪嘿嘿，这可是我和享介一起想出来的！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_d:cmd-000121:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c92896699bc94dffafce2182c701bca85a568d3d3878c64c80b878ac84304047",
      "text": "啊，是在担心能不能真的成功吗？",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_d:cmd-000123:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c694709c2b02c1be3b35fa4431c57d585891f3abd05adee3636ec4dd8e91de8b",
      "text": "没关系！觉得这方案绝对行得通，\n我也好好和享介商量过了。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_d:cmd-000127:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:96fbdd7722e2fa6fdfa6ebdbe64177f07f5479e403386cbd63fbfdeaa6eb585a",
      "text": "太好了！既然●●●●●●●●●●监督\n都这么说了，那就绝对没问题了！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_d:cmd-000130:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8c743bdf51d1c3e7108b62394c197fb6791cc47840e771c74a2b558bec2a395a",
      "text": "啊，不过，光是挑战感觉\n还有点不太够带劲呢～……",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_d:cmd-000132:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:98ee64468980c2d0303194e4a961ef18a6cd1632bf87b1fe810286e7fec38428",
      "text": "比如球掉下来的人要受惩罚游戏，\n或者球掉下来的人要请客便利店之类的……嗯～。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_d:cmd-000134:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c7d6717f9a4ae0a7d770458cb253cc055b2e5807c2961ae1fe0ab76bf5bd830d",
      "text": "下次，●●●●●●●●●●监督也帮我们出出主意吧。\n叫上享介一起开个作战会议！那就先这样啦！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    }
  }
}
